6. Fonts fetched at runtime, which this repository does not redistribute
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Four faces are too large to commit -- the three Noto Sans CJK region faces
(~16.4 MB each) and the COLRv1 Noto Color Emoji face (4.99 MB), 51.8 MB
together. `webapp/src/web_fonts.mjs` serves them from this origin when a
deployment has provisioned them with `webapp/tools/provision-script-fonts.mjs`,
and otherwise falls back to a commit-pinned upstream mirror. Either way the
bytes are verified against a SHA-256 in the manifest before they are used.

Because they are not committed, they carry no attribution above: they are
distributed by their own publishers, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, and
each arrives with the licence records in its own `name` table. A deployment that
provisions them IS redistributing them and should ship the OFL text alongside;
`webapp/assets/fonts/script/OFL-1.1-Noto.txt` is that text. A host that would
rather supply its own faces does so through the same font-registry seam.
